{
  "_comment": "One entry per committed viewer screenshot (report-viewer-standard C1). `setup` runs first, then `build` renders `html` from committed demo data; regen_viewer_screenshots.py captures `shot` from it. {tmp} is a fresh directory per entry. matrize's sketchbook pages (icon-system, sketchbook) are print documents, not stages, and are captured by hand per matrize's README.",
